  "power.neoorigins.wraith_phase.description": "Tụgharịa: gaa n'ihu na ngọngọ siri ike. Mgbe ị nọ n'ime ngọngọ, fepụ n'efu (malie = elu, shift = ala). Obsidian, obsidian na-ebe akwa, na akwa akwa na-egbochi ụzọ gị. Ịgba ọsọ na-ewepụ agụụ.",
